Your Majesty, my lord Archbishop,

The long-awaited instrument has arrived from Rome. It is in Latin, as ever, a=
nd I attach it for the King's scholars to construe at leisure.

The short of it is this: Rome insists the cause be heard there, and not here.=
 I need hardly say how Your Majesty will receive that news.

Your servant,
Thomas Cromwell

